-You don't even know what I want to ask.
-I'm not asking Meryem.

238
00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:56.800
Why not?

239
00:18:57.720 --> 00:19:01.600
That'sâ€¦ No.
Too much has happened in the past.

240
00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:09.520
Meryem?

241
00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:13.320
