-Yes.

281
00:22:22.280 --> 00:22:25.440
-Here. grab your plate. Yeah?
-Yes.

282
00:22:25.520 --> 00:22:28.640
-Will you give him a bath?
-A bath? Alright.

283
00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:31.000
