-Yeah. sure.

284
00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:32.760
It's okay. yeah?

285
00:22:33.680 --> 00:22:39.000
Alright. there we go. And now the hair.

286
00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:42.280
There.

287
