345
00:28:27.160 --> 00:28:30.080
-In Rotterdam?
-Yes.

346
00:28:31.400 --> 00:28:35.000
But it's okay. I'm fine right here.

347
00:28:38.120 --> 00:28:39.120
Are you?

348
00:29:11.840 --> 00:29:14.960
