352
00:29:32.240 --> 00:29:36.800
All you have to do is talk a little.
Sounds good. right? Come on.

353
00:29:36.880 --> 00:29:40.320
{\an8}-Let's go. Sam.
-Hey. Sammie. Hi. boy.

354
00:29:40.400 --> 00:29:42.240
