Listen. Roman. You're going to talk.
If you don't. this won't end well.

356
00:29:47.560 --> 00:29:51.040
It really won't. I swear to you.

357
00:29:52.320 --> 00:29:55.600
-Leave me the fuck alone.
-Sammie. hi.

358
00:29:55.680 --> 00:29:57.280
Leave me alone!

359
