392
00:33:05.640 --> 00:33:07.080
Yummy.

393
00:33:15.240 --> 00:33:18.000
It's kind of exciting. isn't it? All this.

394
00:33:23.280 --> 00:33:25.880
That guy. Yaqubâ€¦

395
00:33:27.080 --> 00:33:29.960
He helps his son with his homework
