-Nico.

450
00:37:07.120 --> 00:37:09.400
To say I did a fantastic job.

451
00:37:23.880 --> 00:37:25.960
Having a nice snack.

452
00:37:30.200 --> 00:37:34.840
So the attack was intended for Frank.

453
00:37:34.920 --> 00:37:37.520
